{"id":"confusion","lemma":"confusion","pos":"noun","rank":3756,"glosses":["confusion"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.fy.zjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-confusion.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-confusion.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"confusions"},"formAudio":{"confusions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-confusions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'était un cas de confusion d'identité.","en":"It was a case of mistaken identity.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"case, situation"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"identity"}]},{"text":"Pour éviter toute confusion, les équipes portaient des couleurs différentes.","en":"To avoid confusion, the teams wore different colors.","words":[{"g":"for"},{"g":"to avoid"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},null,{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"team","l":"équipe"},{"g":"to carry","l":"porter"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"color/colour","l":"couleur"},{"g":"different","l":"différent"}]},{"text":"Il y a d'abord confusion des mots, puis confusion des idées, et enfin confusion des choses elles-mêmes.","en":"First words get confused, then ideas get confused, and finally things themselves get confused.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"d'abord = first"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"word","l":"mot"},{"g":"then"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"idea","l":"idée"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"finally"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"thing","l":"chose"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"same","l":"même"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]}]}